.\n\nThe race has drawn unusual national attention: House Democrats' campaign arm is directing resources to Jones, and he has landed endorsements from Kamala Harris and campaign appearances with national figures. The only independent poll, from Hendrix College in mid-August, showed Jones leading by four points, though it predates the fall campaign. Expert ratings mostly place the race in Likely Republican territory, with prediction markets pricing Jones's chances at roughly one in six, leaving Hill favored but not safe.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.1835, "margin": -5.2}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.3532, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.3233, "margin": -3.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.2423, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.2933, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.1983, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.3205, "margin": -3.5}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.3445, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.2683, "margin": -4.5}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.2665, "margin": -4.5}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.2648, "margin": -4.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.2693, "margin": -4.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.2035, "margin": -5.5}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.2922, "margin": -3.0}]}